## Localhost fake multi-node overrides (opt20260811)
##
## Sourced by simulate_multinode_localhost.sh / validate_multinode_localhost.sh, or:
##   set -a && source .env.workers-sim.example && set +a
##
## MULTINODE_SIM_IP: first non-loopback from `hostname -I` when unset.
## Do NOT use 127.0.0.1 — Frontend/worker containers cannot reach host-published
## ports via loopback hairpin the same way; use the LAN address.
## Host publish ports must match container listen ports (8100/8200), not same-host remaps.
## Requires net.ipv4.ip_forward=1 for container↔LAN hairpin (simulate enables it).
##
## simulate_multinode_localhost.sh sets:
##   FRONTEND_HOST / ADVERTISE_HOST / ROUTER_URL / REGISTRY_URL / ETCD_ENDPOINTS
## from MULTINODE_SIM_IP.
## Skip embeddings in this run: SKIP_EMBEDDING=1 ./simulate_multinode_localhost.sh

# MULTINODE_SIM_IP=192.168.163.151
